docs
scripts
external_assets

# Tests and their fixtures are not part of the runtime image (carried forward from ticket 01).
**/tests/**
**/fixtures/**

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Never bake configuration or secrets into the image.
.env
.env.*

*.md
# ...except the Knowledge Base, which *is* markdown and ships in the image (ADR-0001).
!knowledge/*.md
knowledge/README.md
Makefile
Dockerfile
